    "text": "AZFamily\nwebsite\nPhoenix\nPhoenix man accused of holding woman captive for weeks\n1 days ago\nScottsdale police revealed why three workers were at an independent living facility before a deadly bee attack on Monday. Investigators said Nicolas Soto and two other men were preparing the outside of the building so a beekeeper could get rid of a hive. But during their job, a swarm attacked, stinging all three and killing Soto.\n6",
